# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL overrides the API base URL.
#
# Leave it UNSET in local dev: the app then auto-detects your dev machine's LAN
# IP from the Metro bundler host and targets it on port 8000 (see
# src/api/client.ts). `0.0.0.0` / `localhost` here do NOT work from a phone or
# Android emulator — those point at the device itself, not your dev machine.
#
# Pointing at the Hostinger staging backend. Comment this out to go back to
# auto-detecting a local `php artisan serve --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`.
#
# COMMENTED OUT 2026-09-13 to see course chat: the feature is flag-gated and the flag is
# ON locally but OFF on drosspot.app (where the chat code is not deployed at all), so the
# app pointed there correctly shows no chat tab. Uncomment to go back to staging.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://drosspot.app/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
